es</article-title><source>Addict Behav</source><year>2005</year><volume>30</volume><fpage>1013</fpage><lpage>1018</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15893097</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.addbeh.2004.09.002</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>